-- g2-tests-art6.l4: tests of Article 6, every expected value decided from the Law's text before the module was run.
-- One test per head (a) to (p); the clarifications of 6(2) on both sides of each condition; 6(5); the Regulations and the limit on them; IP11 under both readings of fork F2.5;
-- paragraph (l) under both readings of fork F2.11; paragraph (n) and Article 6(2)(e) under both readings of fork F2.14.

§ `Tests of Article 6`

