§§ `Article 6(2)(a): the advancement of health includes the prevention or relief of sickness, disease or human suffering`

-- src:185 | (a) in paragraph (1)(d), “the advancement of health” includes the prevention or relief of sickness, disease or human suffering;
-- A purpose of that object falls within the heads even when the caller recorded no head.
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the purpose is a charitable purpose` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` `a G2 purpose that falls under no head` `G2 facts: the prevention or relief of sickness, disease or human suffering`
#ASSERT `Art 6(2)(a) the advancement of health includes the purpose` `G2 facts: the prevention or relief of sickness, disease or human suffering`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 6(2)(a) the advancement of health includes the purpose` `G2 facts: nothing relevant`

