#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the purpose is a charitable purpose` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` `a G2 purpose that falls under no head` `G2 facts: the promotion of civic responsibility, volunteering, the voluntary sector or the effectiveness or efficiency of registered charities`
